# Build context for the Sauron image: only what the Dockerfile uses.
# Everything is excluded first, then the needed files are allowed back in. This
# keeps .venv (~5 GB), build/ (~3 GB), uploads/, test data and results out of the
# context sent to Docker/Podman.
*

!requirements.txt
!sauron.py
!SauronGUI.py
!DOCUMENTATION.md
!README.md
!LICENSE
!templates
!templates/**
!static
!static/**

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
